    "show_share": true,
    "description": "5th September 2020 marked the 2nd event of 'Specialized Surgery Series': An unparalleled opportunity for medical students of Pakistan to step into a surgeon's shoes. Over  eighty  aspiring surgeons, from medical schools nationwide, tuned into this virtual event to gain insight into the lives of four practicing surgeons at the Aga Khan University Hospital (AKUH) with the most illustrious and distinguishing careers one can imagine.",
